  - key: 1131175bffe946a5be5945ae5f026010:visibleText:0b5e20c1051243b497ed15e9d4771227
    value: 'Account|First|Last|Status|Target|Notes

      (URL only)|Around {date:-209}|-|Won''t open|Yu-jin|Link Yu-jin received. Handle unknown

      @daylog_041|{date:-180}|{date:-150}|Deleted|Yu-jin|Reportedly gone {date:-145}

      (new URL)|{date:-150}|-|Not seen|Yu-jin|Yu-jin says another account appeared

      @smallroom_08|{date:-127}|{date:-76}|Suspended|Kang Na-rin?|Rin''s Closet = probably Kang Na-rin

      (truncated account)|{date:-127}|{date:-127}|Suspended|Unknown|Only saw photos

      @mildcase_12|{date:-118}|{date:-90}|Active|Unknown|No photos'
  - key: 1131175bffe946a5be5945ae5f026010:visibleText:19437eb7cec749f5b96dc69e0eefbb1d
    value: 'Same crop?

      Similar upload times

      Reposts even after deletion?

      New account after deletion

      Same pattern as Yu-jin?

      Check intervals again'
  - key: 1131175bffe946a5be5945ae5f026010:visibleText:33099d941160490899119b3649eff858
    value: Accounts
  - key: 1131175bffe946a5be5945ae5f026010:visibleText:cea7d494f05e44899a616f19f916fb28
    value: 'Account|Posted|Time|Photo|Text

      @daylog_041|{date:-181}|Night?|Face sticker, center covered, cropped above knees|She took it and sent it herself / face next time

